      <title>MANTECA’S GOAL: TURN CITY’S UTILITY BOXES INTO PUBLIC ART</title>
      <link>https://www.mantecabulletin.com/news/local-news/mantecas-goal-turn-citys-utility-boxes-into-public-art/</link>
      <description>Drab functional municipal utility boxes in the City of Manteca are destined to become works of art. The city is getting ready to launch the Utility Box Art Program. And selected artists will be paid $300 per utility box with a limit of three utility boxes per applicant.</description>
